dc comics has a number of technological  artifacts that are  fundamentally important to understanding  many of its greatest stories  chief among them are the mother boxes  from their mythical origins to their  incredible powers  here's everything you need to know about  dc's mother boxes  before you can understand mother boxes  it's useful to take a detour to  understand dc's  new gods about 18 billion years ago  there was a world named  god world as the planet evolved humanoid  beings sprang forth and developed  vastly powerful abilities over billions  of years  eventually they became gods aka the old  gods  god world fell into internal conflict  between factions of gods  culminating in god world's destruction  and a  massive wave of energy the god wave  spreading throughout the universe  the remnants of god world itself  eventually turned into two distinct  planets  on the one hand there's utopian new  genesis  ruled by the virtuous high father on the  other there's the evil  and dark apocalypse where tyranny and  war reign  these planets become home to a new set  of deities the new gods the new gods of  new genesis are of course  generally wise and just those on  apocalypse who eventually come to be  ruled by the tyrant dark side  are devoted to universal conquest and  tyranny under his malevolent  act each planet has developed  considerably advanced science and  technologies but  the most unique and complex inventions  of the new gods are the mysterious  mother boxes  the sentient super computers that can do  nearly  anything mother boxes owe their  existence to the new gods that inhabits  new genesis  specifically new genesis scientist  jaimon develops the mother boxes as  small  portable sentient supercomputers and as  for haimon he becomes the headmaster of  the academy of higher conscience  before eventually living undercover on  apocalypse  and fomenting rebellion against darkseid  as sentient technology each mother box  is its own unique entity  and has an independent will of its own  and  they get their name for the  unconditional motherly love they have  for their users  plus mother boxes were made as a result  of experiments with the mysterious  element  x dc's 10th metal which can be  manipulated by thought alone  and which powers most new god technology  element x first appeared in new gods  number seven  in effect the whole multiverse is a very  diluted form of this tenth metal  and access to the metal grants powers  beyond comprehension  and since the mother boxes come from  experiments involving element x  these devices are incredibly dangerous  while it's admittedly mysterious how  exactly they work  mother boxes are also known to have  connection to the source  the literal source of all that exists  and the infinite energy that produced  all life in the universe she is a living  computer connected to the source  their complexity means that they can't  truly be made by beings outside new  genesis or apocalypse  and very few new gods have ever been  able to successfully create them  it's even said that the creator's  personality becomes a part of the  resulting mother box  making them one of the dc universe's  most mysterious artifacts  mother boxes are enormously powerful  artifacts  as such their potential is maybe  limitless  and certainly wide-ranging and they've  been utilized by the new gods for nearly  any purpose you can imagine mother boxes  have been used to amplify their users  own powers to considerable degrees  and it doesn't seem to matter much what  those powers are  among the myriad powers mother boxes  have displayed  they've manipulated a host's mental  state allowed telepathic communication  sustained life in hostile environments  returned hosts to life  healed fatal injuries transferred energy  and changed an area's gravity on various  occasions  mother boxes can interact with  technology allowing them to control or  evolve said technology with little  effort  they've even transmuted matter and  energy  or even manipulated dimensions and  merged independent beings  into a composite being they are indeed  effectively limitless perhaps their most  famous use however is as space-bending  transportation devices  mother boxes create extra dimensional  transit tunnels  boom tubes that allow transit through  space  while mother boxes originate from the  new gods of new genesis  father boxes emerge as a similar  technology from apocalypse  albeit with an opposite moral alignment  father boxes first appear in 2001's  orion  vol 1 number 8. they were originally  introduced by darkseid's wife  mortalla as a gift to the heroic orion  evidently presented to replace his  defunct mother box  that of course was a ruse it was  actually intended to bring orion back  under darkseid's control whereas a  mother box is said to be  good loving caring and are attributed a  maternal energy in comic lore  a father box is said to have a pure evil  persona  and is crafted to have male programming  father boxes exhibit most of the varied  uses that mother boxes have showcased in  the comics  including a connection to the source  however where mother boxes are attached  to the creative  living positive good aspects of the  source father boxes access the more  negative portion of the source energies  related to its anti-life aspect  although mother boxes and father boxes  are the most prominent examples of the  new god sentient technology  there are also rare examples of stranger  boxes that serve similar functions  however their natures and backstories  are different from your standard mother  and father boxes the first of these is  the so-called orphan box  created by father time the mysterious  immortal leader of shade  a governmental organization that uses  super-powered individuals to fight  terrorism  father time himself has powers as he is  immortal  possesses super strength and his body  regenerates although it's unclear if he  is in fact a new god  regardless he creates the orphan box  from the remnants of gonzo the  mechanical bastard a being created by  apocalypse's math magicians of the  anti-life equation to spread chaos on  earth  additionally one future timeline  presented in the jla rock of ages  storyline  sees one of darkseid's torturous minions  granny goodness  turned into an insane computer called  alternately either  a grandmother box or more succinctly a  granny box  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite comic book moments are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

